== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|rarity = uncommon
|item_ability_name = Weather
|item_ability_activation = Right Click
|item_ability_description = Allows you to change the weather on your island.
|item_ability_cooldown = 5s
}}
When right-clicked while on a {{Zone|Private Island}}, the Weather Wand opens a menu to change the island's weather, which can be set to sunny, raining, or thundering. There's a 5-second cooldown between every use, and the weather will eventually change on its own.

If a {{Item|Weather Node}} is placed on the island, the weather selected with the Weather Wand will be set in the node, letting it persist until another weather is chosen or the node is removed.

A '''Weather Wand''' can also be given to {{NPCSprite|Professor Wynd}} to obtain their [[Abiphone]] contact.

